To the OSP-4 Contracting Team (please route to the Procuring Contracting Officer for FA8626-25-R-B008):

Exos Aerospace Systems & Technologies, Inc. (Greenville, TX) intends to submit an on-ramp offer under the OSP-4 Suborbital Services solicitation, FA8626-25-R-B008. Our Technical Volume, Executive Summary, and Past Performance volumes are complete, and I would appreciate confirmation of the following so our submission conforms to current requirements:

1. Whether on-ramp submissions are currently being accepted under the rolling on-ramp provision, and any upcoming cut-off dates we should plan against;
2. The correct submission channel (email or portal), the current PCO/POC for this solicitation, and any active amendments we should acknowledge;
3. Whether a brief pre-submission capability discussion with the Space Access program office would be appropriate.

